// Code signing for device builds, kept out of project.pbxproj.
//
// The project's Debug and Release configurations are based on this file.
// Your signing team, and the bundle ID suffix that goes with it, live in
// Signing.local.xcconfig next to it, which is gitignored.
// `npm run ios:device` writes that file for you. To write it by hand:
//
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = AB12CD34EF
//   PLANNER_BUNDLE_ID_SUFFIX[sdk=iphoneos*] = .ab12cd34ef
//
// Then Xcode's own Run button signs with your team too. The suffix gives
// each team its own bundle ID (see scripts/ios-device.mjs); it's for device
// builds only, so simulator builds keep plain dev.angularlynx.planner, which
// is the ID `npm run ios` launches.
//
// Don't pick the team in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities tab: Xcode writes
// that choice into project.pbxproj, which is committed. If you do, the next
// `npm run ios:device` moves it into Signing.local.xcconfig.

#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
